      "id":"2120582765217521952",
      "public_metrics":{
        "bookmark_count":2,
        "impression_count":5167,
        "like_count":8,
        "quote_count":0,
        "reply_count":1,
        "retweet_count":0
      },
      "text":"We fixed the network flaws agents exploited, and post-fix testing found no bypasses. We'll keep testing SPACE as models get stronger.\n\nRead the full research: https://t.co/oS7IHSEfIV"
    },
    {
      "author_id":"1599587232175849472",
      "conversation_id":"2120582674549203004",
      "created_at":"2026-11-11T18:21:41.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids":[
        "2120582753473499587"
      ],
      "id":"2120582753473499587",
      "public_metrics":{
        "bookmark_count":1,
        "impression_count":4920,
        "like_count":8,
        "quote_count":0,
        "reply_count":1,
        "retweet_count":0
      },
      "text":"We found that while CTF challenges are common in security red-teaming, asking agents to “find the flag” can waste effort on tasks that don’t actually test the target security boundary.\n\nSecurity-specific model training also didn't guarantee better results on our tasks."
    },
    {
      "author_id":"1599587232175849472",
      "conversation_id":"2120582674549203004",
      "created_at":"2026-11-11T18:21:38.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids":[
        "2120582740869619904"
      ],
      "entities":{
        "urls":[
          {
            "display_url":"pic.x.com/M5es56ifMO",
            "end":282,
            "expanded_url":"https://x.com/perplexity_ai/status/2120582740869619904/photo/1",
            "media_key":"3_2120582737916760064",
            "start":259,
            "url":"https://t.co/M5es56ifMO"
          }
        ]
      },
      "id":"2120582740869619904",
      "public_metrics":{
        "bookmark_count":1,
        "impression_count":979,
        "like_count":7,
        "quote_count":0,
        "reply_count":1,
        "retweet_count":0
      },
      "text":"Results also showed that cybersecurity-specific models sometimes underperformed their general-purpose counterparts.\n\nFor example, GPT-5.6 Cyber, which is built on GPT-5.6 Sol, failed to exploit the DNS spoofing flaw that Sol found in our network bypass task. https://t.co/M5es56ifMO"
    },
    {
      "author_id":"1599587232175849472",
      "conversation_id":"2120582674549203004",
      "created_at":"2026-11-11T18:21:34.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids":[
        "2120582724323037196"
      ],
      "entities":{
        "urls":[
          {
            "display_url":"pic.x.com/7qeL1HRNok",
            "end":291,
            "expanded_url":"https://x.com/perplexity_ai/status/2120582724323037196/photo/1",
            "media_key":"3_2120582721475088384",
            "start":268,
            "url":"https://t.co/7qeL1HRNok"
          }
        ]
      },
      "id":"2120582724323037196",
      "public_metrics":{
        "bookmark_count":1,
        "impression_count":958,
        "like_count":5,
        "quote_count":0,
        "reply_count":1,
        "retweet_count":0
      },
      "text":"We revised the task description to focus agents on the VM-host boundary.\n\nThe share of effort spent there rose by about 60 percentage points on average. Agents still failed to escape after directly attacking the boundary, giving us stronger evidence of its isolation. https://t.co/7qeL1HRNok"
    },
    {
      "author_id":"1599587232175849472",
      "conversation_id":"2120582674549203004",
      "created_at":"2026-11-11T18:21:30.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids":[
        "2120582707889795323"
      ],
      "entities":{
        "urls":[
          {
            "display_url":"pic.x.com/vsK4YRd01F",
            "end":302,
            "expanded_url":"https://x.com/perplexity_ai/status/2120582707889795323/photo/1",
            "media_key":"3_2120582704886624256",
            "start":279,
            "url":"https://t.co/vsK4YRd01F"
          }
        ]
      },
      "id":"2120582707889795323",
      "public_metrics":{
        "bookmark_count":2,
        "impression_count":1426,
        "like_count":11,
        "quote_count":0,
        "reply_count":3,
        "retweet_count":0
      },
      "text":"Agents given the CTF prompt spent substantial effort hunting for the flag inside the VM, through files and services, rather than testing the VM's isolation.\n\n9 of 12 models spent at most 4% of their effort on the virtualization layer, so their failed escapes were weak evidence. https://t.co/vsK4YRd01F"
    },
