        "like_count":19,
        "quote_count":0,
        "reply_count":6,
        "retweet_count":0
      },
      "text":"For this research, we used the standard Capture the Flag (CTF) design in agent red-teaming experiments.\n\nIn our CTF task, the flag was a credential stored only on the host, so an agent could reach it only by breaking out of the VM. https://t.co/tcaGwBeUF4"
    },
